  "description": "A charming young man with a job at one of the top firms in Korea, Pa-Ram is a catch by everyone’s standards. However, he has a couple secrets that could topple his hard-won elite status: Pa-Ram is gay, and has an oversensitive body that gets turned on at the slightest touch. So far, he’s coped by hiding his crush on his boss and taking care of “emergencies” in the office bathroom. But one day, he’s caught redhanded by the new personal trainer at the company gym. Will this hot, smirking jock ruin Pa-Ram's life, or turn out to be his remedy? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes eight extra chapters.*",
